acceptance_criteria: The approved number is interpreted as permitted promotions and never as a generation ordinal; the seed generation consumes no budget unit; a refused promotion consumes no unit and a subsequent successful promotion of the same candidate consumes exactly one; advancing past the approved count exits non-zero and names the approval item to extend; extending the approval item permits exactly the additional promotions it states; a programme with no approval item refuses at the first promotion rather than at the last; the budget is read from tracked project data and never from an environment variable
resolution: Added test/lineage.test.ts exercising the approved promotion budget and its refusal.
expected_result: Advancing past the approved count exits non-zero and names the approval item; the seed consumes no unit; each promotion consumes exactly one.
actual_result: test/lineage.test.ts passes; index.ts and lineage.ts at 100/100/100 lines/branches/functions.
